# Restart Dev Services

After making code changes in this repo, rerun the shared restart script before finishing the task.

Preferred commands:

```bash
./restart-dev.sh restart --wsl-shutdown
```

Windows alternatives:

```powershell
.\restart-dev.ps1 restart --wsl-shutdown
restart-dev.cmd restart --wsl-shutdown
```

After restart, verify the local stack is healthy:

- Backend responds on `http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs`
- Frontend responds on `http://127.0.0.1:5173/`
- Inngest dev server responds on `http://127.0.0.1:8288/`

Use this rule after substantive code edits, not for read-only exploration.
Prefer the shared restart scripts over ad-hoc per-process start/stop commands.
